    {
      "id": "story/025/dialogue/02.04/0120",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-025.json",
      "source_ja": "「結局、家出同然で転がり込んで来たんだ。\n　メンバーの玩具になるぐらいは\n　我慢してもらわんとな」",
      "source_text_sha256": "fd450f1133d0ca1c10ee9390b93160b1d844287b8bf6c099c9908fdd0bd8f237",
      "decision": "accept_proposal",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T10:57:37.390221+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "ccf4cf6e810a159d0c7b7bf9ef9036bbecfdc876a9825d70680c4dc0694a231e",
      "before": "“说到底，你差不多是离家出走跑来的。\n　得让你忍忍，当大家的玩具才行。”",
      "before_sha256": "7af7f1d66d4babc0b0eb5d362979fa8f5aa045398fbb1565d903ba4327a42b5b",
      "final_translation": "“说到底，他差不多是离家出走跑来的。\n　得让他忍忍，当大家的玩具才行。”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "dd485016028dc71cd11a716d31e95add187810067c9062c125b174f17dcc8b4a",
      "translation_changed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "story/034/dialogue/01.01/0011",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-034.json",
      "source_ja": "「ミムジィ、モーム！　戻って！\n　桂達を出すわ！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "ccfb2e687be9e81d18d31fe67b3d82956a8457727ed6acf9d7dee80f24aace9d",
      "decision": "keep_current",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T10:58:48.647628+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "692ad540953953b427f7fa1dd5e7f043b8ff3acfe0d8846c99b17e5052f665ed",
      "before": "“蜜姆晶、摩姆！回来！我要派出桂了！”",
      "before_sha256": "4d69774f9a3cb399b5b5bb261f476280931ad887fd1d8b2fc3ac98e9ba54dece",
      "final_translation": "“蜜姆晶、摩姆！回来！我要派出桂了！”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "4d69774f9a3cb399b5b5bb261f476280931ad887fd1d8b2fc3ac98e9ba54dece",
      "translation_changed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "story/035/dialogue/02.01/0041",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-035.json",
      "source_ja": "「ヤッサバの女か。\n　すっかり忘れてたが、ヤーパンの天井に\n　潜入していたっけな」",
      "source_text_sha256": "2307d0909a7eb3d8b5b35f334c5428cab7a5baf2162bec2aaf67764107e249af",
      "decision": "keep_current",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T10:59:12.906838+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "2a61e9bb1f39669b691098ac6b82718bc64651a9b504d99782b6d1acb9853e28",
      "before": "“是亚萨巴的女人啊。\n　我都忘了，曾潜入过雅邦天井来着。”",
      "before_sha256": "e8cc48ad9c0b57e94883d34ea1d1cae64ff31b3c3bce17781f65facfdfa06eac",
      "final_translation": "“是亚萨巴的女人啊。\n　我都忘了，曾潜入过雅邦天井来着。”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "e8cc48ad9c0b57e94883d34ea1d1cae64ff31b3c3bce17781f65facfdfa06eac",
      "translation_changed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "story/042/dialogue/02.02/0094",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-042.json",
      "source_ja": "「そういう感情は外に出した瞬間、\n　たちまち自分を食い殺すのを\n　知ってるからさ」",
      "source_text_sha256": "de0996cdfc845ab0a8d46aaa958e9a736d529b1296ba633cca51e9e42ddd91ba",
      "decision": "accept_proposal",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:00:30.513894+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "a07d220f5e29b1fc4f773aab9c02fffdb0235cfd7579d7e494438c8cb64b65f6",
      "before": "“因为我知道，那种感情一旦表露出来，\n　瞬间就会吞噬自己。”",
      "before_sha256": "2c6dfc044d1b54acdff7416d19314e3d384d534ae803d01e09e360a7867a9bfd",
      "final_translation": "“因为他们知道，那种感情一旦表露出来，\n　瞬间就会吞噬自己。”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "ae408d7ffcc407df82bf88514c1deae1b5eb858249fb08dcad00501ad8c820f2",
      "translation_changed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "story/050/dialogue/02.01/0284",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-050.json",
      "source_ja": "「だって、その子の心に触れてあげるもの」",
      "source_text_sha256": "ebfffd5cbc7cb45a0ea7ab36a59d993fd64c2658cb8887e88f5976222a16266a",
      "decision": "accept_proposal",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:01:21.986016+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "9cd275b7f5d4abcccb5959d0ea3c1988069817f68827c5f185de7a569c431211",
      "before": "“因为，那是能触碰到那孩子内心的东西。”",
      "before_sha256": "af09b783ee8fbd66c6fc4a1471d6082666726c56fc250219005f3794a623e215",
      "final_translation": "“因为你愿意去触碰那孩子的内心呀。”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "1491372edfeaf33c35d6fa1ba95e1d3293e0d0ed3bb252e9311ea0fc819872a6",
      "translation_changed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "story/056/dialogue/02.01/0201",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-056.json",
      "source_ja": "「…ぶったね…？」",
      "source_text_sha256": "ba6a30aeb51f717c866763ac8e9251c92b4cf4fce6f6f62f24d7f07a5381e87c",
      "decision": "accept_proposal",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:01:58.596507+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "fe22918533a1162ecd74f1450dc6bb29aec4f8987c51ec4e6459e735d3aa96de",
      "before": "“……被打了吧……？”",
      "before_sha256": "6645ff5ce9b6970d559bbcb5184c2140c1730f1e1bff64c6101102a51703ebd5",
      "final_translation": "“……你打我了……？”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "30e23a124f61aa0128aab2884b28a9995f448d4fa0b145d79ef1e0e9923d2915",
      "translation_changed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "story/066/dialogue/01.12/0007",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-066.json",
      "source_ja": "「ここでチラムをやらせるわけには\n　いかない…！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "be3e13296ed30b14277710ac3ffbc3197ddca43bf88d02fe215947e975582fe2",
      "decision": "accept_proposal",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:02:11.294480+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "81ea9ea6723c2616ceffe5f78e3b47bb39f73635910a7c9e4115487ba303b87b",
      "before": "“不能在这里把奇拉姆干掉……！”",
      "before_sha256": "0ba495b67cf40d21b7eed4b6de4c9c8cbba0d643d915544d830a25c01eeb52c6",
      "final_translation": "“不能让奇拉姆在这里被干掉……！”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "a89478eb42c0432b2015b25dbd8c2001b0285fc0ada14e1a5ddc196085b325d0",
      "translation_changed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "story/085/dialogue/02.01/0098",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-085.json",
      "source_ja": "「でも、俺！\n　ここでガロード達に連れ戻されちゃ、\n　あまりに惨めじゃないか！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "c0a6bd8e0d0c3aa37bd95c6795cea73512df1160c4486cb974cdb95ea43c31c7",
      "decision": "accept_proposal",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:02:30.453767+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "935dba53531a1d50f27dde606f24703bd6436ff2cb957a71b1a50e51346596cc",
      "before": "“可是，我！\n　要是被卡洛德带回去，也太窝囊了！”",
      "before_sha256": "231d41964e0d4e15e3e8c02b894d551ff87800102649ae6fdb0f50a20db389f4",
      "final_translation": "“可是，我！\n　要是被卡洛德他们带回去，也太窝囊了！”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "0a73e20616fb4c94d820e3dde8015ab39d8dfaa6500f4fa73705258f442c72ba",
      "translation_changed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "story/109/dialogue/01.03/0000",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-109.json",
      "source_ja": "「オーブに出撃すると聞いた時は\n　民間人を巻き込むのもやむ無しと\n　するかと思ったが…」",
      "source_text_sha256": "fbc7cfedb1618d377b4a2aa4ceb25c883ae9ba90228158fd2cba0ca07d461615",
      "decision": "keep_current",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:03:34.470034+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "b9272f0f3b573daaabecde649b23bb5cbd4ee72fa3d1c6cb7c1d75f697323e72",
      "before": "“听说要出击奥布时，\n　还以为会不得已卷入平民……”",
      "before_sha256": "550cd757b710e9afc8f04573d284b6fe6b2faea71cdfdc0e3711fb65a1e4682f",
      "final_translation": "“听说要出击奥布时，\n　还以为会不得已卷入平民……”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "550cd757b710e9afc8f04573d284b6fe6b2faea71cdfdc0e3711fb65a1e4682f",
      "translation_changed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "story/110/dialogue/02.01/0033",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-110.json",
      "source_ja": "「我々を敵視するだけでなく、\n　社会を混乱に陥れる事を\n　目的としているようだが…」",
      "source_text_sha256": "cf49721f60b1f15d696b8f12a1803738f3ae60eeed89890947b8b1013a42f737",
      "decision": "keep_current",
      "confirmation_source": "local_review_page",
      "confirmed_at": "2026-09-10T11:04:05.650632+00:00",
      "confirmation_binding": "186cc08cc3e53ef6569250fb93b59e3fa21a9953930990642a5f6cfe01080969",
      "before": "“似乎不仅敌视，\n　还以让社会陷入混乱为目的……”",
      "before_sha256": "10537a4663075d569f0345acef1091092b4ecaca23b59b52081d248bcd382882",
      "final_translation": "“似乎不仅敌视，\n　还以让社会陷入混乱为目的……”",
      "final_translation_sha256": "10537a4663075d569f0345acef1091092b4ecaca23b59b52081d248bcd382882",
      "translation_changed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "story/139/dialogue/01.133/0002",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-139.json",
      "source_ja": "「まさか…！\n　そのためにデューイ・ノヴァクに\n　力を貸している！」",
